  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Shashakta Mahila, Sambriddha Nepal (Empowered Women, Prosperous Nepal - EWPN)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contract related to: Shashakta Mahila, Sambriddha Nepal (Empowered Women, Prosperous Nepal - EWPN) - The Action aims at the achievement of gender equality as an integral element to the realization of the national vision of a prosperous and developed Nepal. The action seeks to address key drivers of gender inequality through an integrated gender transformative approach &#xbf; with a focus on 1) ensuring women/girls are safe, valued and have increased voice, 2) women/men, girls/boys fully enjoy and exercise their equal economic rights, 3) institutions deliver gender equality outcomes in all spheres.</narrative>
  </description>
